  :what "Room that the read path leaves, and decides nothing of: sign-in, in front of the read path (who asks is what the caller says, and `:system` is a who like any other); a network edge, a screen, a view, a tool, an agent; a record of who read what (nothing is kept of a read); a new word of a query (finding by text, looking back, what stands on a fact, everything one person wrote), which is one entry in each of three maps (`softland.store.read-path.query/words`)."}
